<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <h1 class="header"><%= title %></h1>
    <%- include('partials/navbar'); %>
    <div id="indexContent">
        <h2>Welcome To My Music Inventory App!</h2>
        <div>
            <h3>Summary</h3>
            <p>This app enables you to store artists, albums and songs. To create these, please follow this order:</p>
            <ol>
                <li>Create an artist</li>
                <li>Create an album using existing artists</li>
                <li>Create a song using an existing album and artists</li>
            </ol>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h3>IMPORTANT !!! BE CAREFUL WHEN DELETING</h3>
            <p>When deleting an artist, all their albums and songs will be deleted.</p>
            <p>When deleting an album, all the songs in the album will be deleted.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>